OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies hit back at NI
OL,4,Asecretary's comments on Troubles legacy
OL,5,Abill
OL,6,
OL,7,FSome families of people killed during
OL,8,Fthe Troubles have hit back at comments
OL,9,Fby the Northern Ireland secretary that
OL,10,Fhe was worried "some people have
OL,11,Fmisunderstood the purpose" of the
OL,12,Flegacy bill.
OL,14,FSir Chris Bryant insisted it is "full
OL,15,Fsteam ahead" for the government when it
OL,16,Fcomes to passing Troubles' legacy
OL,17,Flegislation through Parliament, during
OL,18,Fa visit to Dublin on Monday.
OL,20,FHe said the bill was "about getting
OL,21,Fanswers for families".
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
