OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies hit back at NI
OL,4,Asecretary's comments on Troubles legacy
OL,5,Abill
OL,6,
OL,7,FClaire Hayes, whose brother Alan
OL,8,FRadford, was killed in the Omagh
OL,9,Fbombing, said the comments from Sir
OL,10,FChris were "vague" and Kate Nash, whose
OL,11,Fbrother William was shot dead on Bloody
OL,12,FSunday in Londonderry, said there was
OL,13,Fno misunderstanding.
